{"text": "It was terribly cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And snow was falling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the city. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was getting dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the last night of the year. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the cold and dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A poor little girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was walking in the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had no hat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And her feet were bare. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she left home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was wearing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her mothers old slippers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were much bigger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than her small feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She lost them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she ran across the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To escape two fast carriages. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A boy ran away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With one slipper. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she could not find the other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now her little feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were red and blue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was carrying. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A lot of matches. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In her old apron. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All day long. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody bought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A single match from her.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "e", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "y", " ", "c", "o", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "s", "n", "o", "w", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "i", "t", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " "